   "text": "I can confirm the assignment is done: LT-0533 is now assigned to Sam Okafor as of today, 28 October, five days before he starts on Monday the 2nd.\n\nI can't see whether the laptop has been physically prepared yet, though. My records cover who owns a device and its status, not imaging or delivery. If you want to be sure it's ready on his desk Monday morning, check with your local IT team about pickup or delivery, or tell me and I'll pass you to a desk lead who can arrange it.\n\nThanks for checking Jamal's desk. If LT-0412 is there, please get it back to Chloe Martin or IT. The ticket stays resolved, and you can message here anytime if anything else comes up for Sam."
